; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Gujarati / ગુજરાતી (gu)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

ખસેડો counter 5

launch_loop:
સિસ્ટમ_કૉલ counter
બાદ_કરો counter 1
સરખામણી counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
ખસેડો box 999
સિસ્ટમ_કૉલ box
